    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Working on steamdeck!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005360/extras/a431613f38063d1cb89b432c099a6ed2.avif?t=1729289534\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive waves of relentless enemies to satisfy the observers. Rack up combos and score to earn money, then upgrade your powers to command respect. Kill them all if you want to survive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005360/extras/bd97250ac63c0099831d195f8ff1acce.poster.avif?t=1729289534\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005360/extras/bd97250ac63c0099831d195f8ff1acce.webm?t=1729289534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005360/extras/bd97250ac63c0099831d195f8ff1acce.mp4?t=1729289534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005360/extras/0bf08cfbdc4af7d03f6a70ee7b98c3fb.avif?t=1729289534\" width=624 height=1518 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Working on steamdeck!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005360/extras/a431613f38063d1cb89b432c099a6ed2.avif?t=1729289534\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive waves of relentless enemies to satisfy the observers. Rack up combos and score to earn money, then upgrade your powers to command respect. Kill them all if you want to survive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005360/extras/bd97250ac63c0099831d195f8ff1acce.poster.avif?t=1729289534\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005360/extras/bd97250ac63c0099831d195f8ff1acce.webm?t=1729289534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005360/extras/bd97250ac63c0099831d195f8ff1acce.mp4?t=1729289534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005360/extras/0bf08cfbdc4af7d03f6a70ee7b98c3fb.avif?t=1729289534\" width=624 height=1518 /></span></p>",
